Now check the last test: "a ledger quoted in an earlier turn never satisfies the gate when the run ends on tool calls" — with my planned change (strip at MessageEndEvent in gate mode), the mid-run message WITH ledger+toolcall gets stripped at MessageEndEvent. Run ends on tool calls → no event. Test still expects no TaskLedgerEvent ✓. But the AgentEndEvent messages — the test doesn't assert ledger presence there. OK.

