/// review): the parsed [TaskLedger] plus the answer text with the ledger
/// span removed. Null when no requirement-bearing ledger parses. The
/// single-scan entry both the `MessageEndEvent` interceptor and the
/// end-of-run fold derive their payloads from — `parseTaskLedger` and
/// `stripTaskLedger` each delegate here, so pairing the event with the
/// stripped answer never re-parses the text.
